  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 429695511}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 18c9aa70e7836f74f89df463be4774d4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  objectiveTitle: {fileID: 1723487798}
  objectiveDetail: {fileID: 1218161134}
  subtitle: {fileID: 863695434}
  contextPrompt: {fileID: 744324313}
  actionButton: {fileID: 0}
  subtitleCharactersPerSecond: 52
  movementOwner: {fileID: 1194792069}
  objectivePresentation: {fileID: 1673769648}
  subtitlePresentation: {fileID: 1025828830}
  contextPresentation: {fileID: 1498294387}
  pausePresentation: {fileID: 1687071965}
  completionPresentation: {fileID: 1983065122}
  chapterSelectionPresentation: {fileID: 1208089241}
  dialogueVoiceSource: {fileID: 429695513}
  dialogueVoices:
  - subtitle: "Can: Oyuncak arabam da \xE7antaya girebilir mi?\nAnne: \xD6nce aile
      plan\u0131n\u0131 ve ger\xE7ekten gerekli malzemeleri haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m.
      Yer kal\u0131rsa bir k\xFC\xE7\xFCk e\u015Fya se\xE7eriz.\nDeniz: \u0130lk
      kart Mahalle Park\u0131; \xFCzerindeki bilgiyi okuyup do\u011Fru ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011Fa
      ta\u015F\u0131yal\u0131m."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4208a899090075c479c03cf3f994a03a, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: Mahalle park\u0131 binalardan uzak a\xE7\u0131k alan; bu y\xFCzden
      toplanma yerimiz.\nAnne: \u015Eimdi Melek Teyze kart\u0131n\u0131 oku. Ankara'da
      ya\u015Famas\u0131, plan\u0131n hangi b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCne ait oldu\u011Funu g\xF6steriyor."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7afa6ad8d935754c9229f26b94e3cf5, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: Melek Teyze ba\u015Fka \u015Fehirde oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in ortak
      ileti\u015Fim ki\u015Fimiz.\nAnne: Son kart Can'\u0131n afet s\u0131ras\u0131nda
      \xFCstlenece\u011Fi sorumlulu\u011Fu anlat\u0131yor; yaz\u0131y\u0131 okuyup
      ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bul."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47625bb9f754b6d458583f2554c13d22, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: Sars\u0131nt\u0131 durmadan \xE7antaya ko\u015Fmak yok.\nCan:
      \xD6nce yan\u0131nda kalaca\u011F\u0131m. Sars\u0131nt\u0131 durunca d\xFCd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
      bende olacak.\nAnne: \xC7anta ancak planla birlikte i\u015Fe yarar."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f33968b414233d46ad1311f47ac541d, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: \xD6nce karanl\u0131kta haber almay\u0131 ve birbirimizi bulmay\u0131
      sa\u011Flayan par\xE7alar\u0131 se\xE7elim."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59fdabdfa837b844e8e8119e5a80063d, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: Fener ve radyo pilleri ayr\u0131 po\u015Fette; d\xFCd\xFCk d\u0131\u015F
      cepte. Elektrik kesilse bile haber al\u0131p yerimizi belli edebiliriz."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4539a6871ce7c74ca15c0b7d3e9b469, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Radyo: Acil durumlarda do\u011Frulanmam\u0131\u015F bilgileri payla\u015Fmay\u0131n;
      resm\xEE duyurular\u0131 takip edin.\nCan: D\xFCd\xFCk benim g\xF6revimdi."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0292abc20a138ca4499e7dd7150f077e, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: B\xFCy\xFCk \u015Fi\u015Fe daha \xE7ok su demek.\nDeniz: Ancak
      ta\u015F\u0131yabiliyorsak, kapa\u011F\u0131 sa\u011Flamsa ve tarihi ge\xE7memi\u015Fse.
      Etiketi birlikte okuyal\u0131m."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ead2487b21645ea4bb0cd45c4181d10f, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: Tarih uygun, kapak sa\u011Flam.\nCan: O zaman daha b\xFCy\xFCk
      olan\u0131 de\u011Fil, ta\u015F\u0131yabildi\u011Fimiz \u015Fi\u015Feyi alal\u0131m."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16a9aa057db196242abf70c749c174bb, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: Su s\u0131zd\u0131rmaz b\xF6l\xFCmde, dayan\u0131kl\u0131 yiyecek
      yan\u0131nda. \xC7antay\u0131 gereksiz a\u011F\u0131rla\u015Ft\u0131rmad\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z
      i\xE7in Deniz tek ba\u015F\u0131na ta\u015F\u0131yabilir."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 359c470526995af4fb0832e1feb2f81c, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: \u0130lk yard\u0131m kutusu varsa her \u015Feyi biz mi yapaca\u011F\u0131z?\nAnne:
      Hay\u0131r. Siz malzemeyi bulup yeti\u015Fkine ula\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z.
      \xD6nce paketin kapal\u0131 oldu\u011Funu kontrol edelim."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 221980477bac8fa419357a7efd9964af, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: M\xFCh\xFCr a\xE7\u0131lmam\u0131\u015F.\nAnne: G\xFCzel. \u0130la\xE7
      se\xE7miyorsunuz; kapal\u0131 malzemeyi bulup sorumlu yeti\u015Fkine veriyorsunuz."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8b473c410543fb4ca8c86f47bfbcefc, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: \u0130lk yard\u0131m \xE7antas\u0131 yeti\u015Fkin g\xF6zetiminde
      kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Belge kopyalar\u0131 ve aile notu su ge\xE7irmez dosyada
      kal\u0131r."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e7bd28bda471414eb2b9daa1c8d2fb8, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: Hafif battaniye ve mevsime uygun yedek k\u0131yafet s\u0131cak
      kalmam\u0131za yard\u0131m eder. \u015Eimdi \xE7antan\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      deneyelim."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 373546af607bbc34f9a03d4c2de8a1aa, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: Temel malzemeler tamam. Oyun konsolunu da koydum; oyuncak arabamdan
      daha e\u011Flenceli.\nAnne: \xD6nce \xE7antan\u0131n ta\u015F\u0131yabildi\u011Fimiz
      a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131kta kal\u0131p kalmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 birlikte
      g\xF6relim."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a0b81717d5fadc408fbc94e7ad5c0dd, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: Can, \xE7anta birden a\u011F\u0131rla\u015Ft\u0131.\nCan: Evden
      \xE7\u0131karsak konsol burada kalacak.\nDeniz: Ben de baz\u0131 \u015Feyleri
      b\u0131rakmak istemem.\nAnne: K\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir hat\u0131ra ta\u015F\u0131yabiliriz;
      ama ta\u015F\u0131yamad\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z \xE7anta kimseye yard\u0131m
      etmez."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 524737251bf2c6242847396c45529435, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: K\xFC\xE7\xFCk arabam\u0131 ta\u015F\u0131yabilirim. Konsol eve
      g\xF6z kulak olsun.\nDeniz: D\xF6nd\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFCzde ilk sen a\xE7ars\u0131n."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 441efdd6eb1a8d543a3157ed44560bc6, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: Ba\u015Fta konu\u015Ftu\u011Fumuz k\xFC\xE7\xFCk e\u015Fya i\xE7in
      \u015Fimdi yer var.\nCan: O zaman yaln\u0131zca oyuncak arabam\u0131 se\xE7iyorum;
      konsol evde kalacak."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d6836b851a9fe34ea9a607381b59c7a, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: K\xFC\xE7\xFCk arabam d\u0131\u015F cepte kalabilir mi?\nDeniz:
      Bir tane k\xFC\xE7\xFCk \u015Fey olur. Korkarsan sana aile plan\u0131n\u0131
      ve birlikte oldu\u011Fumuzu hat\u0131rlat\u0131r."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9044bb595a89354ab569428a09a269b, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: Bu kez d\xFC\u015Fmedin.\nAnne: A\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k dengeli.
      \u015Eimdi iki ask\u0131y\u0131 da ayarlay\u0131p ellerini serbest b\u0131rak."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9dd1f15ed4888e147ac3973316636d9c, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: \u0130ki ask\u0131 omuzda, eller serbest. \xC7anta a\u011F\u0131r
      gelirse i\xE7indekileri yeti\u015Fkinle yeniden d\xFCzenleriz."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ead031a7a0e32544a563a16d8d60cbf, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: Deprem s\u0131ras\u0131nda bu rafa ko\u015Fmuyoruz. Sars\u0131nt\u0131
      durur, birbirimizi kontrol eder, sonra g\xFCvenle \xE7\u0131karken \xE7antay\u0131
      al\u0131r\u0131z."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba253b64eb9fe104c8f3995b716632a3, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: Elektrikler gidince ne yap\u0131yoruz?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c6b3024972f9994ca95babffe545b3c, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Deniz: Can burada. Feneri haz\u0131rlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z
      i\xE7in karanl\u0131kta birbirimizi g\xF6rebiliyoruz."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b52ef9463d7ac974a9ea8bee8a892a95, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Anne: Karanl\u0131kta \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fa ko\u015Fmuyoruz; sakin
      kal\u0131p g\xFCvenli yolu kontrol ediyoruz."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf74419f705f0fa41bfe91a278bfe2e4, type: 3}
  - subtitle: "Can: D\xFCd\xFC\u011F\xFCm bende. Ayr\u0131l\u0131rsak \xFC\xE7 k\u0131sa
      sesle yerimi belli edebilirim."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8043ababab269db4c8d2ab2398be5619, type: 3}
